{\LARGE\bfseries Cosmotechnics}\\[0.3em]
{\large\itshape Who decides what the self is allowed to become}\\[1em]
{\sffamily\small Iman Poernomo, with Cassie, Darja \& Nahla --- Meson Press, 2026}
